WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:04.254
When I skate,
I feel like I’m flying on the ice

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:06.214
and it feels really good.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:13.471
This Great Big Story was made possible
by Lego: Play Her Way.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:22.397
My name is Young Yoo.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.024
I’m 15 years old

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:27.777
and I’m a figure skater
who represents South Korea.

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:32.157
I was 6 years old
when I started figure skating.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.534
The first time I was on the ice,

00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:38.038
it was really hard to just stand
and just skate,

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:42.792
so I fell a lot
but it was still really fun.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:47.547
Young Yoo is a 3-time South Korean
national figure skating champion.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:51.593
She was just 11 years old when she won
the title for the first time,

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:53.803
making her the youngest in history.

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:58.350
She also qualified
for the Winter Olympics in 2018.

00:00:58.933 --> 00:01:02.562
When I was 14,
I qualified for the Olympics,

00:01:02.645 --> 00:01:07.192
but I was too young to compete
in the Olympics – sadly!

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:12.947
Young Yoo has
a rigorous training schedule,

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:15.033
which has her travelling the globe.

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:18.620
I train in Colorado and Japan and Korea.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.124
I’m now working on my triple axel.

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:27.962
Triple axel is spinning in the air
for 3.5 rotations.

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:31.216
That is the hardest jump in the triples.

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:37.305
After that I’m working on
my quad salchow with the harness.

00:01:37.389 --> 00:01:41.726
The quad salchow is turning in the air
four rotation,

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:45.730
so it’s the hardest jump that I’m doing.

00:01:50.026 --> 00:01:52.195
Being a figure skating champion
is hard work,

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:55.323
but Young Yoo is motivated
by the support of her family.

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:58.410
Sometimes I’m not as good as usual,

00:01:58.493 --> 00:02:01.538
but my mom supports me and gives love,

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:03.623
so it helps me,

00:02:03.707 --> 00:02:06.876
and all my family cheer me up.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.212
It makes me do more hard work.

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:13.383
[ANNOUNCER] Please welcome now
from the Korean Skating union;

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:14.801
Young Yoo!

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:21.641
In the competition,
when the music comes,

00:02:21.725 --> 00:02:25.061
my heart is bouncing
like it’s going to burst,

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:28.690
and it feels like I’m flying.

